WEBVTT

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.620
You gave swimming everything you had again today.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.280
As a reward...

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.470
I'll take you to a good place.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.520
A good place?

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.130
What is this good place?

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.630
It's a really nice place.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:10.230
The last place we have to go to is... here?

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.480
Welcome!

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.450
Eh? Ah... yes.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.320
Oh, are the two of you on a date?

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:20.070
Uh...

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.270
Yes!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.990
Um, Senpai... what is this...?

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:25.790
A super-rare event is happening today!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.540
Today is the "precocious little sister's make-believe café" day.

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:33.920
Look forward to the little sisters' chosen ingredients.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.340
Ah~

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.740
Thank you for today.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.620
It was a lot of fun.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.460
I see.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.920
Are you sure you don't want me to take you to the girls' dorm?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.460
That's okay.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.340
All right, I'll see you at school tomorrow.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:15.960
Yeah.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:17.090
Shougo.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:17.920
Ah?

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:18.380
What is it?

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.390
I love you, Shougo.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:32.600
So go out with me, and become my lover.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.190
Miyabi, thank you.

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:38.730
I'm happy you say you love me.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.190
Really?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.450
Then, be my...

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:42.740
I'm sorry.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.720
I can't become your lover.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.740
I thought so...

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:53.000
I knew it, I can't...

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.670
...become Shougo's lover.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:56.710
Miyabi...

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.260
I'm sorry, Miyabi.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.930
This is the only thing I can do right now.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.680
I didn't mean to spy on you...

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.690
Yuzurina, can we talk for a bit?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.450
Yuzurina...

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.530
Unfortunately, it didn't turn out the way you had hoped.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.490
Onii-sama, what are you...?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.160
Getting me and Miyabi together was your plan, wasn't it?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.580
My plan...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.040
On the night of the party, you said something like this, didn't you?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.450
"Even if the illegitimate child is found out,

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:41.110
it still wouldn't be a scandal for anyone but Father."

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:42.920
That's true, but...

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.830
If I became lovers with my blood-related little sister,

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:48.100
not knowing of the scheme...

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.260
What would become of that?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:53.520
If the world found out about it, then it would be my scandal.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.020
Please wait!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.730
I don't understand what this is about.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:02.440
It's true that I thought it would be good if
you and Kannagi-san became lovers, but...

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:06.030
But that was just me thinking about you, as your little sister.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.660
"As your little sister", huh?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.530
Hey, Yuzurina...

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:13.410
We did a DNA test to find out we were siblings, right?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.660
That's right!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.080
You and I are blood-related siblings!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.670
But if the results of that test were fabricated, then...

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.050
That's... Fabricated...

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:30.850
At first, I regretted asking Seri-san to do various things under the pretence of discovering who my little sister was.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.850
The truth was that I had relied on a
person who was my enemy to arrange it...

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.560
I felt like an unimaginable fool.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.060
However...

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.360
I thought, if Seri-san is my enemy,

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:45.190
then I should be able to see the results of the same test done by a different person, using an alias.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.110
You're overthinking it.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.280
Is that right?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.660
Then, about the written invitations you prepared for Konoe and the others...

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:55.660
You said you asked your step-parents,

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.210
but that wasn't the truth.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.410
Then who prepared the written invitations?

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.420
Was it Seri-san?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:06.550
That's right, she begged for you.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.180
The one who prepared the written invitations was Seri-san.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:12.390
What's more, why did she beg on my behalf?

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.810
I wondered what it could mean.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.810
I don't know!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.520
I have no idea what this is about...

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:23.320
Yet, you're doubting me...

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.530
Why...

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.150
Why won't you believe me?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.150
Why don't you drop the act?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.780
Ah, Ikusu.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:34.450
Just accept it, Houshou Yuzurina.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.790
Or maybe it would be better to call you like this?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.790
Danno Nayuri.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.000
Danno Nayuri?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.790
I have the feeling I've heard that somewhere before.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.550
Danno Nayuri.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:51.300
It's the name of the girl who was well known about 10 years ago as a prodigy child actor.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.050
However, a few short years later,

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.810
she disappeared from show business.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.060
Now, almost nobody says that name anymore.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.760
Shougo-kun.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:04.320
You also used to watch Danno Nayuri on TV,

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.490
as Perin-chan from "Restructuring Warrior Gran Belion".

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.620
How dare you...

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.330
Investigating such an uninteresting past...

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.000
So then, it's true!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.540
Shougo Onii-sama.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.840
Rather, Mikadono Shougo.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.630
I admit my defeat.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.840
Why are you doing something like this...?

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:32.260
Why?

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.260
Obviously because it's my job.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.390
As an actress.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.640
I failed in the end, but it was pretty interesting.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.350
Particularly that party.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.730
It was my best work.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.280
What you heard from Secretary Seri's phone at the hotel...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.110
That was me.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.160
Without you finding out about the scheme, I came with you.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:56.280
I was desperately trying to keep up a smile.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.740
Oh my, how frightening!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.270
Even if you don't make a face like that, I failed at my job,

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:03.000
so I'll be leaving immediately.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.960
O-ni-i-sa-ma!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.310
I thought she wasn't straightforward, but what a person...

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:23.190
But with this, for the meantime...

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.430
Hello?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.270
Shougo-san, it's bad!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.140
Kannagi-san is...

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.730
Senpai!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.070
Is Miyabi...?

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.690
Is Miyabi okay?

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.320
Calm down, Mikadono.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:19.070
It seems she almost drowned during the swimming
club's morning practice, but it doesn't look that bad.

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:19.950
Almost drowned?!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.600
I don't know what happened,

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.960
but she's been sobbing ever since she was saved.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.500
She's distraught, so until she calms down,

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.000
she'll be resting in the infirmary.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.500
I see.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.920
Mikadono, did something happen to Miyabi yesterday?

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:42.010
Senpai, since when have you been calling Miyabi by her given name?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.020
As I thought, the one you were hiding was...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:44.770
Mikadono!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.520
What will you gain from having this conversation now?

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:53.030
Not just now... I wanted to have this conversation sooner.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.900
Yet I...

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:59.660
At this rate, she'll be crushed by the weight of what she's been hiding.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.230
It can't...

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:03.120
It can't stay like this!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.910
So, I intend to tell her everything I know.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.170
Are you prepared?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.170
Yes.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.050
Understood.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:22.260
Do you think it was wrong of me to hide her identity?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.390
No.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.310
I'm grateful to you, Senpai,

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:29.230
because you've been protecting my little sister in my place.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.650
I see...

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.520
Thank you.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.370
Shougo.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.910
Sorry, did I wake you up?

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:46.790
No.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.660
I just had my eyes closed.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.170
Is it okay if we talk a little?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.010
I have something I need to apologise to you for...

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.930
If it's about yesterday, it's okay.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.640
I knew you would say something like that.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.970
Not that.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.100
It's not about that.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:11.400
You came to me on the day of Father's funeral service, and yet...

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.110
I'm sorry for not realising it.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.480
On that day, the Miryuuin Academy entrance
exam and Father's funeral service overlapped,

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:21.360
but because you had a sports scholarship...

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.660
You took your exam on a different day.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:24.490
Isn't that right?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:31.040
I asked Kunitachi-san to confirm that
the entrance exam was a different day.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.630
I asked her to tell me if what I thought was wrong.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.680
So, you already know everything.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.090
That's right.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.090
It was me.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.430
It was me who said I came to marry you.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.810
Do you remember when I said my father and
Kumagorou-san met each other at the hospital?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.690
At about that time...

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.320
I'm home!

00:11:57.900 --> 00:11:58.980
Please.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.280
I want you not to say anything and just accept this.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.360
When I heard his voice, I knew right away that it was Kumagorou-san.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:07.280
Right as I was thinking I should greet him, Father...

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.950
No matter how many times you say it, it's troublesome.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.460
Please.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.830
Take this for the sake of my daughter.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:16.290
At first, I didn't understand what they were talking about.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.380
But little by little, I thought "What if..."

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.340
Because that happened,

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.970
my father changed hospitals and I couldn't see you anymore.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.510
At the time, I wasn't convinced, but one day...

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:33.190
I found an envelope filled with money hidden in a chest.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.480
There was also a letter with it.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:38.230
There was something written about an illegitimate child there, right?

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:44.990
It said "This money is for child support. I want you to use this to make my daughter happy".

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:52.370
I realised that Shougo, my first love, was my big brother.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.210
I didn't know what to do.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:13:00.500
But when I found out that Kumagorou-san had died...

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:04.090
I was determined to go see you one more time.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.010
My parents got divorced.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:10.430
My mother, whom I had been living with until then, left the house.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.890
I could only see her from time to time.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.600
Because it's very painful when a family member dies...

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.270
I thought I would comfort you, since you had lost your father.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.610
Then, I thought I could become a new family member.

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.900
New... family member...

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.360
The truth is...

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.990
I wanted to tell you frankly that I was your little sister.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:33.390
But I became nervous, and...

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.200
Besides, when it came to it...

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:36.670
After all, I...

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.040
...wanted to get married.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.630
So when I met you again at Miryuuin Academy,

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.840
I thought I definitely had to keep the
fact that I was your little sister a secret.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.260
Because if I didn't, then I wouldn't be able to marry you.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.770
So, because of that, you kept that secret since the funeral.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:54.560
Yeah.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.350
That's why when Houshou-san said she was your little sister,

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.450
I knew right away she was an imposter.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:03.480
Because of that, I thought if I'm not suspected, it was a lucky break.

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.320
Lucky?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.600
But because you thought you had found your little sister,

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.660
you became lovers with Tsuruma-san.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.450
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.830
I saw it.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.330
You and Tsuruma-san were kissing.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.710
You saw that?

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:22.700
Ah, no.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:23.450
That's not right.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:24.920
That was just an attempt.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.090
But you were going to kiss her, weren't you?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.510
Well, yeah...

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.350
At the time, I was flustered.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.300
The next day, after thinking about it,

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.140
I went to Houshou-san's room.

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:39.140
Then, I would say "I know you're an imposter. Reveal your identity".

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.310
If I knew that Yuzurina wasn't really my little sister...

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:46.110
...you thought I would be hesitant to go out with a girl again?

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.900
But, Houshou-san...

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.160
How did you know that I was an imposter?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:55.910
Because I know the person who received child support from Kumagorou-san.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.790
I understand.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:15:00.920
If that's the case, then I confess.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.340
I'm not his little sister.

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.880
Just a relative.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.470
As a member of his family, to protect his real little sister,

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.430
I took it upon myself to lie.

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:15.840
Now, the matter of the illegitimate child of
the Mikadono Group will be yours to handle.

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:19.600
If it becomes a scandal, she will end up getting hurt as well.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.980
That's why I was hiding the identity of the real little sister.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.440
I want to help her.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:28.940
Kannagi-san, who is it that received the child support?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.950
Will you tell me?

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.240
If that person wants to continue hiding their identity,

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.200
I intend to fully support them.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.620
It was me.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.580
I was the one who received the child support.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:46.690
Do you have something to prove that?

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:47.900
There's a letter.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.420
From Kumagorou-san.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.970
Could you lend that to me for a little while?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.100
I want to verify if it can become proof or not.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.350
Very well.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:01.480
So if you know that I'm the real little sister, you'll support me, right?

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.440
Yes.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:05.020
What would you do, more specifically?

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.480
Let's see...

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:11.110
Then for now, how about I get you an invitation to the party?

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.280
Really?

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:13.500
Yes.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:17.350
However, please bring that letter as proof.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:23.290
If I know that you're the real little sister, I will fully support you.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.380
So that was what happened.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:30.920
Everyone else was invited so that I wouldn't think it was strange that you were there.

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.800
That's probably why.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.590
So, during the party, I snuck out from the assembly hall,

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.220
and met up with Houshou-san in the hotel's café.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:40.350
You didn't give her the letter?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.180
Yeah.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.700
At the last moment, I thought that it wasn't a good idea after all,

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:48.080
but I thought that Houshou-san might get angry.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.370
At that moment,

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:53.420
I said to myself, "If you changed your mind, then it can't be helped".

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:56.620
The result is that Houshou-san also deceived you.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.950
I didn't know what to do.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.500
I was being dim back then.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:06.790
It was probably during that time that she went into the cloakroom and stole the letter from your luggage.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:10.550
By the time I realised, it was already the next morning.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:13.590
I immediately realised what Houshou-san had done,

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:17.510
but since I got set up in such an outrageous trap, I panicked...

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.930
Is that why you took a day off school?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.890
Afterwards, Houshou-san contacted me.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.980
She said that if I was in the dorm, she'd come and see me.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.480
So, that means...

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:27.560
That's right.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:31.110
It happened about an hour before you and Tsuruma-san visited me.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.610
When I asked Houshou-san about the letter...

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:38.240
The letter of proof doesn't exist in the first place.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.660
Isn't that right?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.830
What're you talking about?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.450
Yesterday, I definitely...

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.000
You are not Shougo's little sister.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.790
So you don't have any proof that you're his little sister...

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.290
Right?

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.630
I am Shougo Onii-sama's little sister.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.760
Therefore, as his little sister,

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.760
I will support your relationship with my big brother.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:01.680
Houshou-san...

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:06.560
Doesn't this work out well for the both of us?

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.940
It was strange, the way she said it.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:13.320
I started to think that this was really the best way.

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:17.030
When you suddenly asked me out on a date, was that also...

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.320
I told Houshou-san a lot of things,

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.410
and after I told her about what happened in the suite,

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.240
she said, "Since you've gone that far already, go for one more push".

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.040
"I'll be supporting you"...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.000
Cooperated, eh?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.420
So that's why she said she saw Konoe on the day of the funeral.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.590
Miyabi, I want you to calmly listen to me.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.470
The truth is, Yuzurina's actual identity is...

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.770
I'm sorry.

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.650
I didn't know about that at all.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.610
I... I...

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.450
It's all right, Miyabi.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.950
Everything's been taken care of.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.290
But... But...

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:09.290
If you hadn't thought twice about handing over the letter,

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:12.250
I wouldn't have realised Yuruzina's plan.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.750
So it's fine now.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.010
So then, does that mean you'll forgive me?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.470
Forgive you...? We're siblings, aren't we?

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.720
That's right.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.600
We're siblings, right?

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:37.030
Miyabi, let's become even closer than lovers, as siblings.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:40.260
Closer than lovers, as siblings?

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.430
Ah... We were almost through the preliminaries...

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:14.400
What a shame.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:19.190
The competition was stiff this year, so that was a hard-earned result.

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.820
Ah, Kannagi-san...

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.610
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.610
Even though all of you came to support me...

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.700
What are you talking about?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.370
You achieved a personal best, so it's a big deal.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.370
You did well, Miyabi.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.680
I see.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:44.880
Yuzurina is missing...

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:49.430
I was somehow able to follow the trail, but it disappeared somewhere.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.600
For the time being, this is an acceptable outcome,

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.480
because your opposition probably won't meddle with you for a while.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.900
But it's still best to be cautious.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:57.810
Yeah.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.940
Even if something happens, I'll show you I can protect my little sister.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.360
Ah, there you are!

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:13.540
We heard a male student chattering away on the rooftop.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.880
I thought that it would definitely be Shougo.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:21.210
Shougo-san, do you intend to make babies with Mizutani-kun?

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.840
Even though you have me to do that.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:23.760
How shameless!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.490
You've found your little sister,

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:28.010
so from now on, no matter which girl it is,

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.240
you can relax and kiss them.

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.720
So when you choose the route...

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:36.270
If that's the case, then you already have my marriage prerequisite...

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:40.190
In that case, my strawberries... No, not just them...

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:43.010
Please eat my cream puffs as well!

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.020
No way!

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.780
Onii-chan belongs to me!

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.580
What are you talking about?

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:49.370
That's right!

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.530
That's unforgivable!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.950
Shougo-kun is so popular...

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.170
We won't let you get away!

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.420
Give me a break!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:04.130
Wait for me!

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:24.980
The love that ran away is searching for Eden

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:36.580
Despite losing my bearings, I understood the weight I felt from you

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:42.210
We felt it on that summer day

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:48.300
Do you regret our meeting because of these painful lies?

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:54.310
Are you saying it was only painful?

00:22:54.310 --> 00:23:01.940
Sweep away the coming tomorrow with those gentle hands

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:08.030
A promise forever from bygone days

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:14.780
We will certainly be together, because I still believe in you

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:20.790
My pounding heart won't stop now

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:26.880
It has finally begun, that lovely thing

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:38.600
To a dazzling world of bewilderment with my heavenly lover

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:45.270
Shougo-kun, now that you know who your little sister is we can finally move forward to the the real objective, right?

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:49.160
Um... Shougo-san, you can have my cream puffs right away, then.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:52.260
Tsuruma-san, you need to clean the room before that.

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:52.770
Yes!

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:54.770
When you're finished with that, the preview is next.

00:23:54.770 --> 00:23:57.830
Next time, Episode 13. Big Brother - Little Sister - Lover.

00:23:57.830 --> 00:23:59.830
Oh my. There's dust on the sliding paper door

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:00.750
I'm sorry!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:01.540
Good grief.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:04.850
Huge breasted girls these days are too busy with their cream puffs.

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:06.650
They can't even clean properly.

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:08.740
One of them is my sister-in-law!
